(355696, 28163, 6025, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, but seems to lose class. If you had used a pretty lighter of some kind, perhaps. Also, the flame is rather unimpressive - the blue part of the flame (while BEING the hottest) gives no impression of heat - the inferno of red and yellow does that. (6)</td>', 'Cool idea, but seems to lose class. If you had used a pretty lighter of some kind, perhaps. Also, the flame is rather unimpressive - the blue part of the flame (while BEING the hottest) gives no impression of heat - the inferno of red and yellow does that. (6)', '2003-07-14 07:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(355697, 28639, 7466, '<td valign="top">I like the color and the light, but without the title, I would have had no idea what it was.</td>', 'I like the color and the light, but without the title, I would have had no idea what it was.', '2003-07-14 07:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(355698, 28065, 6025, '<td valign="top">Technically, this image is suffering. It seems very over-sharpened along the edges, and - despite the intense heat - you don''t get the impression of heat. I think this might be a glassblower''s oven - if it is, why didn''t you snap the glass just as it came out? Oh well, good location, but not too good execution. (4)</td>', 'Technically, this image is suffering. It seems very over-sharpened along the edges, and - despite the intense heat - you don''t get the impression of heat. I think this might be a glassblower''s oven - if it is, why didn''t you snap the glass just as it came out? Oh well, good location, but not too good execution. (4)', '2003-07-14 07:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(355699, 27782, 7466, '<td valign="top">A clearer focus on the egg would have been nice.  As it stands, you almost don''t notice the egg because of the focal point at the bird''s head.</td>', 'A clearer focus on the egg would have been nice.  As it stands, you almost don''t notice the egg because of the focal point at the bird''s head.', '2003-07-14 07:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
