(355758, 28563, 8522, '<td valign="top">My favourite this challenge, the sepia tones work well. You have communicated the heat very well, this picture has a lot of character. I''m not sure about the cropping at the top... too many items seem to have been cut in half. The fan works very well though. Nicely exposed. Great legs! 9</td>', 'My favourite this challenge, the sepia tones work well. You have communicated the heat very well, this picture has a lot of character. I''m not sure about the cropping at the top... too many items seem to have been cut in half. The fan works very well though. Nicely exposed. Great legs! 9', '2003-07-14 09:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(355759, 28724, 8522, '<td valign="top">Darn, why didn''t I think of that? I was going though tea-light and ice combinations in my mind''s eye... but you''ve done a much better job than I would have done! The black background is great, and you have successfully managed to avoid the usual noise that a photo like this in low light would typically generate. My one criticism is that I don''t like the colour of the ice here... it looks a bit dirty yellow, perhaps a colour balance on the highlights might have done the trick (perhaps a slight shift to blue), or perhaps a bit of desaturation on yellow. 8</td>', 'Darn, why didn''t I think of that? I was going though tea-light and ice combinations in my mind''s eye... but you''ve done a much better job than I would have done! The black background is great, and you have successfully managed to avoid the usual noise that a photo like this in low light would typically generate. My one criticism is that I don''t like the colour of the ice here... it looks a bit dirty yellow, perhaps a colour balance on the highlights might have done the trick (perhaps a slight shift to blue), or perhaps a bit of desaturation on yellow. 8', '2003-07-14 09:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(355760, 28506, 8522, '<td valign="top">What is it? I can''t make out a thing in this picture, it''s too small. 1</td>', 'What is it? I can''t make out a thing in this picture, it''s too small. 1', '2003-07-14 09:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(355761, 28373, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, but there''s too much JPEG artifacting, especially around the sun. The noise is very distracting as well. The sun is too in the centre for the composition to be effective, and I can''t help wishing for something else in the picture to add interest. 4</td>', 'Nice colours, but there''s too much JPEG artifacting, especially around the sun. The noise is very distracting as well. The sun is too in the centre for the composition to be effective, and I can''t help wishing for something else in the picture to add interest. 4', '2003-07-14 09:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(355763, 28449, 8522, '<td valign="top">Aren''t these creatures from the Arctic Circle? That''s why this doesn''t convey warmth to me. It just makes me confused! I wish you''d captured his/ her face, as it is, the eye isn''t sure what to focus on. I find it settles on the wrinkles, which I don''t think should be the focal point. The patterns of colours in the background look haphazard, and don''t add to the composition. The shadow looks a little harsh as a result of shooting in the midday sun. 5</td>', 'Aren''t these creatures from the Arctic Circle? That''s why this doesn''t convey warmth to me. It just makes me confused! I wish you''d captured his/ her face, as it is, the eye isn''t sure what to focus on. I find it settles on the wrinkles, which I don''t think should be the focal point. The patterns of colours in the background look haphazard, and don''t add to the composition. The shadow looks a little harsh as a result of shooting in the midday sun. 5', '2003-07-14 09:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(355764, 28558, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great idea... shame that your chillies weren''t anti-aliased, the pixelated look really detracts here. The composition is a bit too centred for my taste... 3 symmetrical chillies and a diagonal across the centre make this crop a bit unimaginative for me. 6</td>', 'Great idea... shame that your chillies weren''t anti-aliased, the pixelated look really detracts here. The composition is a bit too centred for my taste... 3 symmetrical chillies and a diagonal across the centre make this crop a bit unimaginative for me. 6', '2003-07-14 09:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(355765, 28563, 5266, '<td valign="top">Looks straight out of a Tennessee Williams play!!!  Nice job with the sepia</td>', 'Looks straight out of a Tennessee Williams play!!!  Nice job with the sepia', '2003-07-14 09:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(355766, 28591, 8522, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah, what a great idea! I don''t like the lighting though, which looks like it was a bit harsh. The shadows indicate that there was one light source which wasn''t diffused. I think you could have made more of the reflective qualities of the surface that the ice is on... I don''t think enough thought went into the composition of the ice cubes. The empty space at the top left especially doesn''t work for me. The water droplets are very effective however. 6</td>', 'Oh yeah, what a great idea! I don''t like the lighting though, which looks like it was a bit harsh. The shadows indicate that there was one light source which wasn''t diffused. I think you could have made more of the reflective qualities of the surface that the ice is on... I don''t think enough thought went into the composition of the ice cubes. The empty space at the top left especially doesn''t work for me. The water droplets are very effective however. 6', '2003-07-14 09:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(355767, 28400, 5266, '<td valign="top">Great color!!!  Love the look of this photo.</td>', 'Great color!!!  Love the look of this photo.', '2003-07-14 09:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
