(356053, 28433, 8522, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand how this conveys temperature... are these candles? If so, they''re hard to make out. The picture is far too small. Interesting effect from using extreme wide-angle, the glare is pretty bad though from the reflections of the light source. 3</td>', 'I don''t understand how this conveys temperature... are these candles? If so, they''re hard to make out. The picture is far too small. Interesting effect from using extreme wide-angle, the glare is pretty bad though from the reflections of the light source. 3', '2003-07-14 14:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(356062, 28351, 6600, '<td valign="top">Great shot, sure has the ''cute'' factor going for it.  Excellent composition.  Super job!</td>', 'Great shot, sure has the ''cute'' factor going for it.  Excellent composition.  Super job!', '2003-07-14 14:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(356063, 28579, 8522, '<td valign="top">Greasy food seldom looks good in photographs, I''m afraid this one is no exception. I know this SHOULD convey a sense of heat, but it just doesn''t do it for me. The composition isn''t quite right... it just doesn''t seem balanced. The ratio of frying pan to table, and the ridge in the table, and the amount of spatula that''s showing, and the cheese... it doesn''t work for me. It looks also like not much thought went into the lighting which is too harsh. There''s too much glare in the egg yolks, and the shadow in the frying pan looks accidental. 4</td>', 'Greasy food seldom looks good in photographs, I''m afraid this one is no exception. I know this SHOULD convey a sense of heat, but it just doesn''t do it for me. The composition isn''t quite right... it just doesn''t seem balanced. The ratio of frying pan to table, and the ridge in the table, and the amount of spatula that''s showing, and the cheese... it doesn''t work for me. It looks also like not much thought went into the lighting which is too harsh. There''s too much glare in the egg yolks, and the shadow in the frying pan looks accidental. 4', '2003-07-14 14:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(356067, 28385, 6600, '<td valign="top">Great exposure and composition.  Nice and sharp with nice colors.  The selected border would not be my first choice, but it seems to work ok here.  I especially like the graduation to ''dark'' at the bottom (nice contrast).  The different colors were a nice touch.  Very nice job!</td>', 'Great exposure and composition.  Nice and sharp with nice colors.  The selected border would not be my first choice, but it seems to work ok here.  I especially like the graduation to ''dark'' at the bottom (nice contrast).  The different colors were a nice touch.  Very nice job!', '2003-07-14 14:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(356068, 28700, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and clear with decent composition.  The condensation lets the viewer know of the contrasting (warmer) temperatures.  Good job!</td>', 'Very sharp and clear with decent composition.  The condensation lets the viewer know of the contrasting (warmer) temperatures.  Good job!', '2003-07-14 14:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(356070, 28523, 6600, '<td valign="top">Though my first thought of this photo was not cool water, it is most certainly a very nice photo.  Unless there were some undesirable objects above the waterfall, I would have preferred to see just a bit more at the top.</td>', 'Though my first thought of this photo was not cool water, it is most certainly a very nice photo.  Unless there were some undesirable objects above the waterfall, I would have preferred to see just a bit more at the top.', '2003-07-14 14:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(356079, 28639, 8171, '<td valign="top">Incredible colours, though it might have looked even better if it was a little lighter all over - well done - 8</td>', 'Incredible colours, though it might have looked even better if it was a little lighter all over - well done - 8', '2003-07-14 14:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(356082, 28498, 8171, '<td valign="top">Nude or temperature challenge? lol - well done for the original thought - 7</td>', 'Nude or temperature challenge? lol - well done for the original thought - 7', '2003-07-14 14:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(356084, 28589, 8171, '<td valign="top">Very creative :o) - though wide angle and lower would have looked even better - 8</td>', 'Very creative :o) - though wide angle and lower would have looked even better - 8', '2003-07-14 14:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
