(356141, 28755, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of the colors, and how it looks like the elements are floating in space.  Also, you have prevented some "flatness" by the skewed perspective.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of the colors, and how it looks like the elements are floating in space.  Also, you have prevented some "flatness" by the skewed perspective.', '2003-07-14 15:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(356146, 28344, 811, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I think the shot would have been just as effective without the thermometer.  Also a little wider crop on the left would make it feel more balanced for me, I think.</td>', 'Hmmm, I think the shot would have been just as effective without the thermometer.  Also a little wider crop on the left would make it feel more balanced for me, I think.', '2003-07-14 15:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
