(356227, 28707, 7628, '<td valign="top">now really, how hot can it get in Iceland? I was there once when it hit 80 in the day and people were swiming in glacial rivers but that was highly unusual.  Nevertheless, those clouds do look like they are on fire!  I like how you''ve used the hill Perlan is on to obscure the busy cityscape (except for Halgrimskirkja) and help the composition focus on the clouds.</td>', 'now really, how hot can it get in Iceland? I was there once when it hit 80 in the day and people were swiming in glacial rivers but that was highly unusual.  Nevertheless, those clouds do look like they are on fire!  I like how you''ve used the hill Perlan is on to obscure the busy cityscape (except for Halgrimskirkja) and help the composition focus on the clouds.', '2003-07-14 17:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(356231, 28454, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very hot!  I like the range of textures - the craggy rock, the flaming bright sparks, and the billowing hazy clouds of smoke.  I wish there was some clue to the scale of the photo - the size might be impressive.  Perhaps including more of the smoke disappearing into the black night?</td>', 'Very hot!  I like the range of textures - the craggy rock, the flaming bright sparks, and the billowing hazy clouds of smoke.  I wish there was some clue to the scale of the photo - the size might be impressive.  Perhaps including more of the smoke disappearing into the black night?', '2003-07-14 17:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(356234, 28404, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I missed the snow ball at first - would like to see a composition that focuses in more of the snowball.  It would look more like hell if we couldn''t see the brisk at the back of the foreplace. I like the leaping flames andI like the colors in the flames - that purple at the bottom looks cool - I mean hot.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I missed the snow ball at first - would like to see a composition that focuses in more of the snowball.  It would look more like hell if we couldn''t see the brisk at the back of the foreplace. I like the leaping flames andI like the colors in the flames - that purple at the bottom looks cool - I mean hot.', '2003-07-14 18:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
