(356249, 28601, 7628, '<td valign="top">Poor bloke really looks wiped out.  The lack of color and the soft focus add to the feeling of this "temperature."  Simple but efffective - only wish the towel didn''t have to stitching on the right - plain white would have been better.</td>', 'Poor bloke really looks wiped out.  The lack of color and the soft focus add to the feeling of this "temperature."  Simple but efffective - only wish the towel didn''t have to stitching on the right - plain white would have been better.', '2003-07-14 18:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
