(356256, 28757, 7628, '<td valign="top">Wow!  time to defrost!  I like how it looks like a cave with dripping stalactites.  The shaddows and lines of the fridge in the background are a bit distracting ''tho the setting knob is the perfect hint of place.  Wish things were a little sharper - I imagine the lighting was difficult.</td>', 'Wow!  time to defrost!  I like how it looks like a cave with dripping stalactites.  The shaddows and lines of the fridge in the background are a bit distracting ''tho the setting knob is the perfect hint of place.  Wish things were a little sharper - I imagine the lighting was difficult.', '2003-07-14 18:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(356258, 28163, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like your idea of hainv contrasts in temp.  I like the blue of the flame witht the bit of orange, but wish it was more prominent.  Too mush of the composition is white - contradicting the the tension in the subject.  If you could have a larger flame, or a lens that could bring you closer in.</td>', 'I like your idea of hainv contrasts in temp.  I like the blue of the flame witht the bit of orange, but wish it was more prominent.  Too mush of the composition is white - contradicting the the tension in the subject.  If you could have a larger flame, or a lens that could bring you closer in.', '2003-07-14 18:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
