(356266, 28344, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the detail in the icecube at the top.  The ones toward the bottom of the picture are too soft.</td>', 'I like the detail in the icecube at the top.  The ones toward the bottom of the picture are too soft.', '2003-07-14 18:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(356285, 28563, 7969, '<td valign="top">This shot surely captures the title and topic.  Sepia tone, makes it feel old, pre-air-conditioning, and the prescence of the fan emphasizes it all the more.  The rumpled bed and discarded papers and leg position certainly make for ''a lazy look''.  Normally my preference is for an ''uncluttered'' shot, yet  I think the items in this pic really add to it.  I like it nice work.</td>', 'This shot surely captures the title and topic.  Sepia tone, makes it feel old, pre-air-conditioning, and the prescence of the fan emphasizes it all the more.  The rumpled bed and discarded papers and leg position certainly make for ''a lazy look''.  Normally my preference is for an ''uncluttered'' shot, yet  I think the items in this pic really add to it.  I like it nice work.', '2003-07-14 19:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(356286, 27782, 7969, '<td valign="top">Now what i am really wanting to know is how you got so close to this pigeon??  The perspective really adds, and the sharpness of his head and eyes pretty amazing,  I wonder if you shot it in macro mode or portrait and wonder how would of looked in landscape.  just curious, nice job.</td>', 'Now what i am really wanting to know is how you got so close to this pigeon??  The perspective really adds, and the sharpness of his head and eyes pretty amazing,  I wonder if you shot it in macro mode or portrait and wonder how would of looked in landscape.  just curious, nice job.', '2003-07-14 19:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(356287, 28395, 7969, '<td valign="top">Love the blus tones.  she looks familiar from another challenge i think i recognize the sunglasses.  What are those little white marks in the background?  nice work</td>', 'Love the blus tones.  she looks familiar from another challenge i think i recognize the sunglasses.  What are those little white marks in the background?  nice work', '2003-07-14 19:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
