(356418, 28629, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. I would like to see the lemon slice to be in focus like the glass if that is possible. A glass with no pattern might be a better choice, but that''s only my taste. Crop and perspective great. 6</td>', 'Nice colors. I would like to see the lemon slice to be in focus like the glass if that is possible. A glass with no pattern might be a better choice, but that''s only my taste. Crop and perspective great. 6', '2003-07-14 23:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
