(356423, 28591, 7543, '<td valign="top">Hehe, great idea! The black background might be something different, looks like a black plastic bag to me. Like it 7</td>', 'Hehe, great idea! The black background might be something different, looks like a black plastic bag to me. Like it 7', '2003-07-14 23:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
