(356464, 28589, 6359, '<td valign="top">Since you took the time to cook an egg in the middle of the strips and it appears that your road is in the middle of the picture. I think you should have started the strips in the middle and not to the right.</td>', 'Since you took the time to cook an egg in the middle of the strips and it appears that your road is in the middle of the picture. I think you should have started the strips in the middle and not to the right.', '2003-07-15 00:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(356465, 28092, 6600, '<td valign="top">This certainly is a very chaotic fire.  While it speaks ''hot'' in volumes, I do not find it that pleasing to the eye.  Composed as a photojournalism type shot.  My favorite part is the eyes departure to the live tree branch.</td>', 'This certainly is a very chaotic fire.  While it speaks ''hot'' in volumes, I do not find it that pleasing to the eye.  Composed as a photojournalism type shot.  My favorite part is the eyes departure to the live tree branch.', '2003-07-15 00:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
