(356470, 28568, 6600, '<td valign="top">I see you have met your match :) - Decent compositon and color.  Nice job.  Possilbe critique: Might have looked neat seeing a tad more of the match stick as it disappeared into the blackness.</td>', 'I see you have met your match :) - Decent compositon and color.  Nice job.  Possilbe critique: Might have looked neat seeing a tad more of the match stick as it disappeared into the blackness.', '2003-07-15 00:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
