(356480, 28126, 326, '<td valign="top">LOL Good one!</td>', 'LOL Good one!', '2003-07-15 00:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(356481, 28351, 8953, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF in this shot as well as the young lady lounging in the bucket in the water one of the few shots with people and water that gave me the feeling of temperature. Good Job.</td>', 'I like the DOF in this shot as well as the young lady lounging in the bucket in the water one of the few shots with people and water that gave me the feeling of temperature. Good Job.', '2003-07-15 00:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(356482, 28385, 8953, '<td valign="top">Super shot...I lick my lips each time I look at it...now if I could just reach in and grab it!. The light on the rim sets this off well. I think it may be just me but the light border was just a tad to thick for my taste. overall one of my favorites this round 8</td>', 'Super shot...I lick my lips each time I look at it...now if I could just reach in and grab it!. The light on the rim sets this off well. I think it may be just me but the light border was just a tad to thick for my taste. overall one of my favorites this round 8', '2003-07-15 00:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(356484, 28351, 326, '<td valign="top">This is too cute! Good job!</td>', 'This is too cute! Good job!', '2003-07-15 00:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(356489, 28529, 8953, '<td valign="top">I Love Oreos! On ice? sounds good...wheres the milk? the vapor looks great!7</td>', 'I Love Oreos! On ice? sounds good...wheres the milk? the vapor looks great!7', '2003-07-15 01:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(356490, 28563, 1717, '<td valign="top">great photo!  has a lazy afternoon feel to it.  i love the tones and composition.  good work!</td>', 'great photo!  has a lazy afternoon feel to it.  i love the tones and composition.  good work!', '2003-07-15 01:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(356491, 28743, 8953, '<td valign="top">Such a simple "looking" shot but I bet you had some set up time. the flame looks great! good job.</td>', 'Such a simple "looking" shot but I bet you had some set up time. the flame looks great! good job.', '2003-07-15 01:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(356492, 28653, 1717, '<td valign="top">lol...now THAT''S hot!  great DOF!</td>', 'lol...now THAT''S hot!  great DOF!', '2003-07-15 01:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(356493, 28454, 7969, '<td valign="top">I keep looking at your phot to try and tell what it is thats on fire.  Looks like rocks, is it a volcano?  You obviously got very close to it at any rate.  good capture</td>', 'I keep looking at your phot to try and tell what it is thats on fire.  Looks like rocks, is it a volcano?  You obviously got very close to it at any rate.  good capture', '2003-07-15 01:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(356495, 28765, 7969, '<td valign="top">generally i prefer the out in the world shots to the staged variety, but from time to time there are staged shots that stop me in my tracks, and one must give credit where credit is due.  This shot certainly gets high marks by me in terms of the color.  particularly of the ice.  I almost wish it was just of the ice.  Not sure how you got the ice this color but i like it .  nice work</td>', 'generally i prefer the out in the world shots to the staged variety, but from time to time there are staged shots that stop me in my tracks, and one must give credit where credit is due.  This shot certainly gets high marks by me in terms of the color.  particularly of the ice.  I almost wish it was just of the ice.  Not sure how you got the ice this color but i like it .  nice work', '2003-07-15 01:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(356496, 28523, 8953, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites  this round. I can feel the cooling mist.7</td>', 'One of my favorites  this round. I can feel the cooling mist.7', '2003-07-15 01:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(356497, 28422, 7969, '<td valign="top">I commend this shot for :  the tones, the tiny visible hairs, the curve, and I commend the model  (who must love the photographer a lot)  that they stayed still with an ice cube on back to pose for shot.  Nice work, both of you  :  )</td>', 'I commend this shot for :  the tones, the tiny visible hairs, the curve, and I commend the model  (who must love the photographer a lot)  that they stayed still with an ice cube on back to pose for shot.  Nice work, both of you  :  )', '2003-07-15 01:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(356499, 28629, 8953, '<td valign="top">great balance in the shot. the colors seem just a little washed out and the lemon is just a little out of focus. I still think it works.</td>', 'great balance in the shot. the colors seem just a little washed out and the lemon is just a little out of focus. I still think it works.', '2003-07-15 01:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(356500, 28507, 7969, '<td valign="top">well, it is clear, but the shot is lacking in WOW factor,  it tells the temperture but it does not convey heat.   ( sorry not a more positive comment, but i am trying to give more feedback- hopefully to improve my skills and yours as to what is good and not good photo)  keep up the efforts.</td>', 'well, it is clear, but the shot is lacking in WOW factor,  it tells the temperture but it does not convey heat.   ( sorry not a more positive comment, but i am trying to give more feedback- hopefully to improve my skills and yours as to what is good and not good photo)  keep up the efforts.', '2003-07-15 01:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(356501, 28350, 7969, '<td valign="top">hmm.. mostly this shot while technically good makes me sad, what a waste of a good ice cream cone  :  )</td>', 'hmm.. mostly this shot while technically good makes me sad, what a waste of a good ice cream cone  :  )', '2003-07-15 01:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(356505, 28163, 8953, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the contrast of the background and the black and white feel of the shot. if the flame was a bit stronger this would have been even better to me IMHO:)</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the contrast of the background and the black and white feel of the shot. if the flame was a bit stronger this would have been even better to me IMHO:)', '2003-07-15 01:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(356506, 28469, 8953, '<td valign="top">Great Flames! love the way the black works its way through the light.</td>', 'Great Flames! love the way the black works its way through the light.', '2003-07-15 01:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(356507, 28397, 8953, '<td valign="top">clever title to go with your double exposure.</td>', 'clever title to go with your double exposure.', '2003-07-15 01:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(356508, 28485, 8953, '<td valign="top">A tough shot to take! I like the concept. I wish the ball could have been captured in the shot:(</td>', 'A tough shot to take! I like the concept. I wish the ball could have been captured in the shot:(', '2003-07-15 01:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(356510, 28632, 7969, '<td valign="top">I tried to shoot a few people as they were jooging trying to get someone who looked HOT, I took probably 20 shots, none of them looked like they were excersizing at all really, so i used a different shot, but this guy, I m impressed looks legitimitely hot, the color in in his face and the sweaat on his brow-- good capture.</td>', 'I tried to shoot a few people as they were jooging trying to get someone who looked HOT, I took probably 20 shots, none of them looked like they were excersizing at all really, so i used a different shot, but this guy, I m impressed looks legitimitely hot, the color in in his face and the sweaat on his brow-- good capture.', '2003-07-15 01:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(356513, 28466, 8953, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better for me if the focus was more toward the camera side of the wok, the blur is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I think this would have worked better for me if the focus was more toward the camera side of the wok, the blur is a bit distracting.', '2003-07-15 01:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(356515, 28563, 8953, '<td valign="top">More of the model and the bed and less of the cluter all around.  it all just becomes a bit distracting.</td>', 'More of the model and the bed and less of the cluter all around.  it all just becomes a bit distracting.', '2003-07-15 01:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(356517, 28498, 8953, '<td valign="top">I think this shot could have had more a feeling of temp. if it were in color. the background needed to be lit up more. the shadow from the ice is over powering the rest of the shot. The concept is great on the other hand:)</td>', 'I think this shot could have had more a feeling of temp. if it were in color. the background needed to be lit up more. the shadow from the ice is over powering the rest of the shot. The concept is great on the other hand:)', '2003-07-15 01:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(356519, 28313, 8953, '<td valign="top">I like the steam concept:) the shadow from the pot and the two color background takes away from this shot.</td>', 'I like the steam concept:) the shadow from the pot and the two color background takes away from this shot.', '2003-07-15 01:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(356521, 28506, 8953, '<td valign="top">just to small to make out:( I had the same trouble with one of my images. I can help you to insure a larger image next time.</td>', 'just to small to make out:( I had the same trouble with one of my images. I can help you to insure a larger image next time.', '2003-07-15 01:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(356596, 28163, 5253, '<td valign="top">Hola cielo, pensaba que te podia votar!, la foto no está mal pero creo que el problema está en que la llama es muy débil y pierde mucha fuerza, besitos, te quiero!!</td>', 'Hola cielo, pensaba que te podia votar!, la foto no está mal pero creo que el problema está en que la llama es muy débil y pierde mucha fuerza, besitos, te quiero!!', '2003-07-15 05:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(356598, 28767, 8860, '<td valign="top">This image is too heavily effected suggesting that it may be a poor quality original. If did look striking as a thumbnail though, so maybe less FX and a smaller size would have helped. [4]</td>', 'This image is too heavily effected suggesting that it may be a poor quality original. If did look striking as a thumbnail though, so maybe less FX and a smaller size would have helped. [4]', '2003-07-15 05:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(356599, 28385, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very satisfying - good focus and colours. [7]</td>', 'Very satisfying - good focus and colours. [7]', '2003-07-15 05:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(356601, 28738, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. Really shows the nature of summer frivolity and, by deduction, temperature! [7]</td>', 'Very nice capture. Really shows the nature of summer frivolity and, by deduction, temperature! [7]', '2003-07-15 06:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(356604, 28757, 8860, '<td valign="top">I like this idea and the shapes of the ice. Maybe a fster shutter speed would help as it would have been good to see that droplet just hanging in space. [6]</td>', 'I like this idea and the shapes of the ice. Maybe a fster shutter speed would help as it would have been good to see that droplet just hanging in space. [6]', '2003-07-15 06:26:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(356605, 28598, 8860, '<td valign="top">That''s a very hot car - get some a/c. [5]</td>', 'That''s a very hot car - get some a/c. [5]', '2003-07-15 06:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(356607, 28207, 8860, '<td valign="top">Looks very refreshing (since I''m hot at the moment). [7]</td>', 'Looks very refreshing (since I''m hot at the moment). [7]', '2003-07-15 06:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(356608, 28558, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea - but the image is a bit noisy. Perhaps it would have been better to make the final image smaller to reduce that. After all it would not detract from the concept or the effect. [7]</td>', 'This is a great idea - but the image is a bit noisy. Perhaps it would have been better to make the final image smaller to reduce that. After all it would not detract from the concept or the effect. [7]', '2003-07-15 06:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(356611, 28395, 8860, '<td valign="top">Wasn''t nude the previous challenge? I suppose it must be hot then - or you''re a masochist.</td>', 'Wasn''t nude the previous challenge? I suppose it must be hot then - or you''re a masochist.', '2003-07-15 06:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(356617, 28759, 10221, '<td valign="top">not sure what shrinking has to do with heat to be honest</td>', 'not sure what shrinking has to do with heat to be honest', '2003-07-15 07:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(356619, 28563, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great photo, it''s just screaming hot and lazy. I can almost feel the breeze of the fan in the background.  Very good, my pick for a top three finish - Gary.</td>', 'Great photo, it''s just screaming hot and lazy. I can almost feel the breeze of the fan in the background.  Very good, my pick for a top three finish - Gary.', '2003-07-15 07:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(356620, 28351, 5728, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, it''s just screaming lazy, summer vacation. I feel like grabbing my sunglasses and suntan lotion just looking at it.</td>', 'Lovely photo, it''s just screaming lazy, summer vacation. I feel like grabbing my sunglasses and suntan lotion just looking at it.', '2003-07-15 07:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(356621, 28639, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color tones. The photo has such a crispy cool feel to it, and depicts temperature perfectly. My choice for a top 3 finish - Gary.</td>', 'Beautiful color tones. The photo has such a crispy cool feel to it, and depicts temperature perfectly. My choice for a top 3 finish - Gary.', '2003-07-15 07:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(356622, 28529, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a very good idea, very original. The cold vapors rising around the cookies are what really boost this image, well done.</td>', 'This is a very good idea, very original. The cold vapors rising around the cookies are what really boost this image, well done.', '2003-07-15 07:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(356623, 28730, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good one, ya got me wanting a beer now, and I''m still at work! The play of the sunlight on the chilled bottles does a lot for this pic.</td>', 'Good one, ya got me wanting a beer now, and I''m still at work! The play of the sunlight on the chilled bottles does a lot for this pic.', '2003-07-15 07:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(356624, 28700, 5728, '<td valign="top">Yum, Heineken! How did you get that ice looking so white? My ice always turns out transparent. Love the cool feel to this photo. Did ya drink all that afterwards?</td>', 'Yum, Heineken! How did you get that ice looking so white? My ice always turns out transparent. Love the cool feel to this photo. Did ya drink all that afterwards?', '2003-07-15 07:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(356625, 28400, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!!! This is my wife''s favourite photo she told me. And looking at it again I can see why. Somehow I must have missed this when I first voted. Maybe the phone rang or something when I voted on it. Anyway, it is excellent, the background is very fitting. Bumped from an 8 to a 10 - Gary</td>', 'Beautiful shot!!! This is my wife''s favourite photo she told me. And looking at it again I can see why. Somehow I must have missed this when I first voted. Maybe the phone rang or something when I voted on it. Anyway, it is excellent, the background is very fitting. Bumped from an 8 to a 10 - Gary', '2003-07-15 07:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(356626, 28621, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good effect, very sharp and detailed. What a pity you can''t spot edit to get rid of those spots on the water.</td>', 'Good effect, very sharp and detailed. What a pity you can''t spot edit to get rid of those spots on the water.', '2003-07-15 07:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(356627, 28607, 5728, '<td valign="top">I feel the heat almost :-) Good idea and well composed. An excellent depiction of temperature.</td>', 'I feel the heat almost :-) Good idea and well composed. An excellent depiction of temperature.', '2003-07-15 07:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(356628, 28073, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very good depiction of the challenge, this is good! With a polarizer filter it would have been excellent! You''ll still get a good score for sure.</td>', 'Very good depiction of the challenge, this is good! With a polarizer filter it would have been excellent! You''ll still get a good score for sure.', '2003-07-15 07:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(356630, 28454, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow, where did you go to take this photo? Looks either like a bush fire or a volcano. Or is this some kind of set up photo? Can''t wait to see the description on this. The effect is very successful, that''s for sure. I think you ''ll do well with this photo!</td>', 'Wow, where did you go to take this photo? Looks either like a bush fire or a volcano. Or is this some kind of set up photo? Can''t wait to see the description on this. The effect is very successful, that''s for sure. I think you ''ll do well with this photo!', '2003-07-15 07:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(356632, 28743, 5728, '<td valign="top">Cool colors there. The detail is good, the negative space too, good job.</td>', 'Cool colors there. The detail is good, the negative space too, good job.', '2003-07-15 07:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
