(359505, 28454, 6325, '<td valign="top">Frodo, you must throw the Ring into the fires from which it was forged.<br/>Great shot.</td>', 'Frodo, you must throw the Ring into the fires from which it was forged.Great shot.', '2003-07-17 00:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(359520, 28351, 6325, '<td valign="top">Too cute. Well composed and exposed.</td>', 'Too cute. Well composed and exposed.', '2003-07-17 01:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(359521, 28686, 6325, '<td valign="top">Now, that''s cool looking. Great colors. A little cramped on the right side.</td>', 'Now, that''s cool looking. Great colors. A little cramped on the right side.', '2003-07-17 01:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(359602, 28348, 4517, '<td valign="top">122 thats hot. Here in England we`ve never had 100.</td>', '122 thats hot. Here in England we`ve never had 100.', '2003-07-17 06:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(359650, 28084, 3540, '<td valign="top">Just a little soft on the focus.  I''m sure the shutter speed was quite low on this one which explains everything.</td>', 'Just a little soft on the focus.  I''m sure the shutter speed was quite low on this one which explains everything.', '2003-07-17 09:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(359651, 28373, 3540, '<td valign="top">Badly pixelated.  Needs to be shot at higher res or not cropped so much.</td>', 'Badly pixelated.  Needs to be shot at higher res or not cropped so much.', '2003-07-17 09:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(359652, 28594, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the framing of this one at all.</td>', 'I don''t understand the framing of this one at all.', '2003-07-17 09:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(359653, 28586, 3540, '<td valign="top">Generally the horizon goes horizontally across the picture.</td>', 'Generally the horizon goes horizontally across the picture.', '2003-07-17 09:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(359654, 28344, 3540, '<td valign="top">I hope that thermometer didn''t just come right out of the fishtank.  Good idea though to add some color to this pretty cold (colorwise) photo.  DOn''t know how sanitary it is though.</td>', 'I hope that thermometer didn''t just come right out of the fishtank.  Good idea though to add some color to this pretty cold (colorwise) photo.  DOn''t know how sanitary it is though.', '2003-07-17 09:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(359655, 27782, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this bird is real or not, but it doesn''t look very real at all.  The eggs look a little big for it in any event.  Good Luck</td>', 'I don''t know if this bird is real or not, but it doesn''t look very real at all.  The eggs look a little big for it in any event.  Good Luck', '2003-07-17 09:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(359656, 28678, 3540, '<td valign="top">No idea what this is.</td>', 'No idea what this is.', '2003-07-17 09:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(359756, 28766, 3094, '<td valign="top">Great Perspective.  I see it was windy too.  People could be a little more crisp, although the bright day can distort that a little.</td>', 'Great Perspective.  I see it was windy too.  People could be a little more crisp, although the bright day can distort that a little.', '2003-07-17 11:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(359758, 28225, 3094, '<td valign="top">I feeel cold!  Nice job</td>', 'I feeel cold!  Nice job', '2003-07-17 11:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(359823, 28757, 1041, '<td valign="top">Met the challenge.  Good catch to have the drop in mid-air.  You might want to defrost your freezer ;)  I think some level adjustment would help here, there seems to be no real black and no real white in the photo.</td>', 'Met the challenge.  Good catch to have the drop in mid-air.  You might want to defrost your freezer ;)  I think some level adjustment would help here, there seems to be no real black and no real white in the photo.', '2003-07-17 13:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(359825, 28563, 1041, '<td valign="top">I love this.  It''s not your standard "something cold or hot" interpretation of the challenge that many have used, but your shot says "hot" much more than the others, at least to me.  The composition is wonderful and all the clutter in the background actually help round off this image.  Make it look more real and less staged I guess.  Sepia works really well, as does the border.  I''m hoping you have a winner here :)</td>', 'I love this.  It''s not your standard "something cold or hot" interpretation of the challenge that many have used, but your shot says "hot" much more than the others, at least to me.  The composition is wonderful and all the clutter in the background actually help round off this image.  Make it look more real and less staged I guess.  Sepia works really well, as does the border.  I''m hoping you have a winner here :)', '2003-07-17 13:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(359827, 28765, 1041, '<td valign="top">Now there''s a nice twist on the gas flame / icecube theme.  I like it a lot.  Makes a nice abstract, but you can recognize what you are looking at when looking closer.  The focus and colors are great.  Not sure about the empty space at the top, maybe just a little more cropping would be an improvement.  After the challenge, I''d also change the color in the flames on the right to be blue, but that''s obviously not allowed for the challenge and not that important.  One of my top 5 picks for this week :)</td>', 'Now there''s a nice twist on the gas flame / icecube theme.  I like it a lot.  Makes a nice abstract, but you can recognize what you are looking at when looking closer.  The focus and colors are great.  Not sure about the empty space at the top, maybe just a little more cropping would be an improvement.  After the challenge, I''d also change the color in the flames on the right to be blue, but that''s obviously not allowed for the challenge and not that important.  One of my top 5 picks for this week :)', '2003-07-17 13:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(359828, 28755, 1041, '<td valign="top">Best one of the stove top photos in my mind.  I like the abstractness of it and how they seem to float in space.  The bold colors of the border work really well here, too.  In my top five picks this week.</td>', 'Best one of the stove top photos in my mind.  I like the abstractness of it and how they seem to float in space.  The bold colors of the border work really well here, too.  In my top five picks this week.', '2003-07-17 13:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(359830, 28544, 1041, '<td valign="top">What an exquisite photo.  I like it and not just because it reminds me of my entry to the "No Hand of Man" challenge ;)  I guess you must be living somewhere where it''s winter right now ... .  I like the drops and the red berries poking through. The background is not distracting (good) but I wouldn''t complain if it was even more uniform (cardboard held/positioned behind the object often works for me).  Still, one of my top five picks this week.</td>', 'What an exquisite photo.  I like it and not just because it reminds me of my entry to the "No Hand of Man" challenge ;)  I guess you must be living somewhere where it''s winter right now ... .  I like the drops and the red berries poking through. The background is not distracting (good) but I wouldn''t complain if it was even more uniform (cardboard held/positioned behind the object often works for me).  Still, one of my top five picks this week.', '2003-07-17 13:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(359831, 28400, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great one.  I love the bright colors, really makes me feel that I''m looking straight into a burning fire.  Nice double-play on ''hot'', too.  Normally, I''d say I want to see some hotsauce in the bottle, but on second thought I don''t think it would work here.  Just curious though if you tried.  In my top five picks this week. :)</td>', 'Great one.  I love the bright colors, really makes me feel that I''m looking straight into a burning fire.  Nice double-play on ''hot'', too.  Normally, I''d say I want to see some hotsauce in the bottle, but on second thought I don''t think it would work here.  Just curious though if you tried.  In my top five picks this week. :)', '2003-07-17 13:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(359859, 28755, 10281, '<td valign="top">Very creative</td>', 'Very creative', '2003-07-17 13:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(359896, 28563, 6999, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of something - and it''s taken me two days to work out what: a series of photos by Antonin Kratochvil called ''Sideshow''. Those were actually of circus sideshow freaks, but it''s the compoitional technique and the darkness and contrast that I''m thinking of. This is the only photo of this challenge which truly communicates a feeling of heat to me: of the desire not to move, the effort even of reading proving too much, the derperation for some movement of air. The lifted skirt just adds that extra element of hunting for the slightest breeze.<br/> <br/>Wonderful work.</td>', 'This reminds me of something - and it''s taken me two days to work out what: a series of photos by Antonin Kratochvil called ''Sideshow''. Those were actually of circus sideshow freaks, but it''s the compoitional technique and the darkness and contrast that I''m thinking of. This is the only photo of this challenge which truly communicates a feeling of heat to me: of the desire not to move, the effort even of reading proving too much, the derperation for some movement of air. The lifted skirt just adds that extra element of hunting for the slightest breeze. Wonderful work.', '2003-07-17 14:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(359900, 28092, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture - one of the secrets of good photography is of course getting yourself to the right place at the right time. The foreground tree adds some useful contrast to the intensity of the fire. Excellent exposure, wonderful detail and there''s still some sense of movement there. My only slight gripe is that I might like to have seen more context than that single branch - certainly meets the challenge, but for me in a slightly too straightforward way - in that it''s only about heat, and not about, for instance, reaction to heat as well.</td>', 'Wonderful capture - one of the secrets of good photography is of course getting yourself to the right place at the right time. The foreground tree adds some useful contrast to the intensity of the fire. Excellent exposure, wonderful detail and there''s still some sense of movement there. My only slight gripe is that I might like to have seen more context than that single branch - certainly meets the challenge, but for me in a slightly too straightforward way - in that it''s only about heat, and not about, for instance, reaction to heat as well.', '2003-07-17 14:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(359904, 28763, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''ve scored this pretty high not so much because of any great feeling of temperature coming from it, but simply for the wonderful quality of the shot: one of the better portraits i''ve ever seen here. A small note would regarding the composition: my eye is pulled away from the girl by both the brightness to the left and the shade to the right - I think there''s probably enough foreground brightness to have allowed you to crop out the rock to the upper left and still maintain the effect. perhaps you could also have cropped to the child''s head more closely at the top: this looks rather like it may have come straight out of the camera this way.</td>', 'I''ve scored this pretty high not so much because of any great feeling of temperature coming from it, but simply for the wonderful quality of the shot: one of the better portraits i''ve ever seen here. A small note would regarding the composition: my eye is pulled away from the girl by both the brightness to the left and the shade to the right - I think there''s probably enough foreground brightness to have allowed you to crop out the rock to the upper left and still maintain the effect. perhaps you could also have cropped to the child''s head more closely at the top: this looks rather like it may have come straight out of the camera this way.', '2003-07-17 14:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(359911, 28730, 6999, '<td valign="top">:-) ''Warning - not a life saving device'' indeed - might have made a great title. Looks like it might well save my life some days! More seriously - a fine shot, but perhaps a little compromised by the framing - for me, it could have been either more closely or more widely framed, either to focus on the bber or the context.</td>', ':-) ''Warning - not a life saving device'' indeed - might have made a great title. Looks like it might well save my life some days! More seriously - a fine shot, but perhaps a little compromised by the framing - for me, it could have been either more closely or more widely framed, either to focus on the bber or the context.', '2003-07-17 15:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(359914, 27782, 6999, '<td valign="top">Hope this isn''t too close to your house: I''ve just had pigeons nest on my balcony, and you will not believe the mess that gets made whilst the chicks are growing, not the effort you''ll need to get rid of them once they''ve started flying.<br/> <br/>Good shot - though i think its connection to the challenge is just a little forced. No, it''s a great shot - but the second part still applies.</td>', 'Hope this isn''t too close to your house: I''ve just had pigeons nest on my balcony, and you will not believe the mess that gets made whilst the chicks are growing, not the effort you''ll need to get rid of them once they''ve started flying. Good shot - though i think its connection to the challenge is just a little forced. No, it''s a great shot - but the second part still applies.', '2003-07-17 15:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(359918, 28555, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice crop, and nice idea. Would like to have seen a more intersting subject for the lower part of the frame though - the bush/trees doesn''t particularly help the feeling of heat for me.</td>', 'Nice crop, and nice idea. Would like to have seen a more intersting subject for the lower part of the frame though - the bush/trees doesn''t particularly help the feeling of heat for me.', '2003-07-17 15:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(359919, 28124, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great shot, great composition too - almost like a Bierstadt painting. Could have used some noise reduction perhaps.</td>', 'Great shot, great composition too - almost like a Bierstadt painting. Could have used some noise reduction perhaps.', '2003-07-17 15:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(359921, 28589, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like the idea - but it looks rather like you put a fried egg on the road, rather than the road fried the egg.</td>', 'I like the idea - but it looks rather like you put a fried egg on the road, rather than the road fried the egg.', '2003-07-17 15:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(359923, 28653, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - but looks like an egg got pre-fried and then placed on the road - even more than the other version of this idea does. perhaps if you''d partially fried it and then put it down it would convince more?</td>', 'Nice idea - but looks like an egg got pre-fried and then placed on the road - even more than the other version of this idea does. perhaps if you''d partially fried it and then put it down it would convince more?', '2003-07-17 15:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(359924, 28225, 6999, '<td valign="top">That very brutal flash lighting really doesn''t help this shot. Beyond that, maybe a little steam coming from the cup or something would aid the illusion. It''s more of a pity as there looks to be some really interesting textures here.</td>', 'That very brutal flash lighting really doesn''t help this shot. Beyond that, maybe a little steam coming from the cup or something would aid the illusion. It''s more of a pity as there looks to be some really interesting textures here.', '2003-07-17 15:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(359926, 28433, 6999, '<td valign="top">I can''t see any relevance to the challenge subject here whatsoever - even after some thought.</td>', 'I can''t see any relevance to the challenge subject here whatsoever - even after some thought.', '2003-07-17 15:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(359927, 28712, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting reflection - I can;t figure out why it is doubled, or why the flower was frozen or is that broken glass?  The colors and the light are glowing (good!)</td>', 'Interesting reflection - I can;t figure out why it is doubled, or why the flower was frozen or is that broken glass?  The colors and the light are glowing (good!)', '2003-07-17 15:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(359931, 28548, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice droplet!  The glowing ball of the sun is excellent!  All that reflected light and color in the cube are great too.  I might crop more on the bottom (either include all of the eye or nix it)  The red glare above the nose is too bad - perhaps you could crop in from the sides to loose it?</td>', 'Nice droplet!  The glowing ball of the sun is excellent!  All that reflected light and color in the cube are great too.  I might crop more on the bottom (either include all of the eye or nix it)  The red glare above the nose is too bad - perhaps you could crop in from the sides to loose it?', '2003-07-17 15:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(359933, 28361, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the green background - it makes me thin of soft moss.  Lots of nice little details in the ice - a little soft on the left edge, but what can you do with melting ice?</td>', 'I like the green background - it makes me thin of soft moss.  Lots of nice little details in the ice - a little soft on the left edge, but what can you do with melting ice?', '2003-07-17 15:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(359936, 28507, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting how the lines of light create auras of color.  However too lacking in  the 3rd dimension for me.</td>', 'Interesting how the lines of light create auras of color.  However too lacking in  the 3rd dimension for me.', '2003-07-17 15:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(359938, 28710, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice frosty sparkles.  With another light source, less exposed, and greater depth of focus you;d get an even better feel for the curves and lines of the snow.</td>', 'Nice frosty sparkles.  With another light source, less exposed, and greater depth of focus you;d get an even better feel for the curves and lines of the snow.', '2003-07-17 15:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(359940, 28433, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like all those different light sources illuminating the glass.  Wish it had greater DOF for crisper lines.</td>', 'I like all those different light sources illuminating the glass.  Wish it had greater DOF for crisper lines.', '2003-07-17 15:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(359941, 28523, 8722, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. It has a very serene setting, and I like what you did with the shutter speed, by slowing it down and making it look a little misty. Very good, I enjoy it.</td>', 'I like this photo. It has a very serene setting, and I like what you did with the shutter speed, by slowing it down and making it look a little misty. Very good, I enjoy it.', '2003-07-17 15:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(359944, 28707, 8722, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo. The only request I have, is that you shift the camera a little more to the left, the smaller building and tree''s are kind of irritating to me, but other than that, it is a marvelous picture. Good job</td>', 'This is a nice photo. The only request I have, is that you shift the camera a little more to the left, the smaller building and tree''s are kind of irritating to me, but other than that, it is a marvelous picture. Good job', '2003-07-17 15:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(359946, 28469, 7628, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and shapes.  I''m not sure how I feel about the lack of focus (or the blurring of the flickering flames)  It looks nice, but my eye feels it has nothing to anchor it.</td>', 'I love the colors and shapes.  I''m not sure how I feel about the lack of focus (or the blurring of the flickering flames)  It looks nice, but my eye feels it has nothing to anchor it.', '2003-07-17 15:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(359984, 28563, 7038, '<td valign="top">great pic, love the choice for sepia on this one.  Defintely conveys the image of hot and humid.</td>', 'great pic, love the choice for sepia on this one.  Defintely conveys the image of hot and humid.', '2003-07-17 16:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(359985, 28589, 7038, '<td valign="top">good idea, the egg looks like its been placed on the pavement well after cooking though with the curled up edges, would''ve been top notch if you could get it to look like the egg was sizzling somehow, not sure how you''d be able to do that though.</td>', 'good idea, the egg looks like its been placed on the pavement well after cooking though with the curled up edges, would''ve been top notch if you could get it to look like the egg was sizzling somehow, not sure how you''d be able to do that though.', '2003-07-17 16:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(359987, 28591, 7038, '<td valign="top">excellent idea</td>', 'excellent idea', '2003-07-17 16:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(359988, 28558, 7038, '<td valign="top">excellent idea, just a bit grainy though (the pepper pic not your photo i think), not sure if that was your intent or not. ill still give it a 7</td>', 'excellent idea, just a bit grainy though (the pepper pic not your photo i think), not sure if that was your intent or not. ill still give it a 7', '2003-07-17 16:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(359992, 28361, 7038, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, just wish the upper left part of the heart were more in focus as its the only unclear part of the picture.  Also the border seems to be crowding in on the left part of the heart. 7</td>', 'Excellent idea, just wish the upper left part of the heart were more in focus as its the only unclear part of the picture.  Also the border seems to be crowding in on the left part of the heart. 7', '2003-07-17 16:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(360094, 28385, 10346, '<td valign="top">i can feel the heat just looking at the glass.</td>', 'i can feel the heat just looking at the glass.', '2003-07-17 19:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(360137, 28579, 1202, '<td valign="top">Well composed and technically super.  Makes me hungry.  7</td>', 'Well composed and technically super.  Makes me hungry.  7', '2003-07-17 20:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(360139, 28738, 1202, '<td valign="top">Your ability to see beyond the scene is shown here.  Very nice job.   8</td>', 'Your ability to see beyond the scene is shown here.  Very nice job.   8', '2003-07-17 20:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(360141, 28126, 1202, '<td valign="top">Take more that those fans to cool those two hotties.   Great picture.   7</td>', 'Take more that those fans to cool those two hotties.   Great picture.   7', '2003-07-17 20:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(360143, 28127, 1202, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective, it is only lacking in holding my interest.   6</td>', 'Simple but effective, it is only lacking in holding my interest.   6', '2003-07-17 20:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(360145, 28397, 1202, '<td valign="top">Quick manuvering here to make an effective point.  Nice job.  6</td>', 'Quick manuvering here to make an effective point.  Nice job.  6', '2003-07-17 20:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(360148, 28743, 1202, '<td valign="top">Good use of light and well composed.  The interest wears off quickly though.   6</td>', 'Good use of light and well composed.  The interest wears off quickly though.   6', '2003-07-17 20:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(360150, 28586, 1202, '<td valign="top">Strange how much a breezeway helps.  He is on his third rug, I usually start over after using two \ :)  6</td>', 'Strange how much a breezeway helps.  He is on his third rug, I usually start over after using two \ :)  6', '2003-07-17 20:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(360151, 28400, 1202, '<td valign="top">That works for me.  Nice job  8<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-07-21 08:45:40.</i></td>', 'That works for me.  Nice job  8', '2003-07-17 20:28:01.000000', '2003-07-21 09:45:40.000000', 1),
(360153, 28558, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice to see the imagination at work.  Nice job, I wish your prints of the peppers were sharper.  7</td>', 'Nice to see the imagination at work.  Nice job, I wish your prints of the peppers were sharper.  7', '2003-07-17 20:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(360156, 28702, 1202, '<td valign="top">A little crisper shot would have helpd you here.   Good idea.  6</td>', 'A little crisper shot would have helpd you here.   Good idea.  6', '2003-07-17 20:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(360165, 28535, 1202, '<td valign="top">Very good exposure control.  Hot?   8</td>', 'Very good exposure control.  Hot?   8', '2003-07-17 20:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(360171, 28506, 7670, '<td valign="top">I can''t really tell what this is because it is very small.</td>', 'I can''t really tell what this is because it is very small.', '2003-07-17 20:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(360172, 28544, 7670, '<td valign="top">Nice ice.</td>', 'Nice ice.', '2003-07-17 20:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(360181, 28351, 1202, '<td valign="top">My favorite so far.   Wonderful picture, it would hang anywhere.  10</td>', 'My favorite so far.   Wonderful picture, it would hang anywhere.  10', '2003-07-17 20:45:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(360182, 28707, 1202, '<td valign="top">You caught this one right.   Good job.  9</td>', 'You caught this one right.   Good job.  9', '2003-07-17 20:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(360184, 28757, 1202, '<td valign="top">Sure would have been nice to not have the knob in here.   Very ice perspective otherwise.   7</td>', 'Sure would have been nice to not have the knob in here.   Very ice perspective otherwise.   7', '2003-07-17 20:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(360291, 28603, 8367, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I''d like to see it cropped tighter so the whole subject fills the frame. A bit too much black space.</td>', 'Nice idea. I''d like to see it cropped tighter so the whole subject fills the frame. A bit too much black space.', '2003-07-17 23:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(360296, 28707, 8367, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.</td>', 'Beautiful capture.', '2003-07-17 23:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(360300, 28712, 8367, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection. The flower could be sharper but the effect is nice overall.</td>', 'Nice reflection. The flower could be sharper but the effect is nice overall.', '2003-07-17 23:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(360307, 27918, 8367, '<td valign="top">Good composition and dof.  Nice photo of a spoiled pooch. LOL  We give ours Frosty Paws...ice cream cups made for dogs. He loves them.</td>', 'Good composition and dof.  Nice photo of a spoiled pooch. LOL  We give ours Frosty Paws...ice cream cups made for dogs. He loves them.', '2003-07-17 23:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(360310, 28692, 2612, '<td valign="top">I love the way you froze the water and captured the child inside the fountain. I keep following the line produced by the front most fountain up the picture and away from the child. Lines can be a powerful tool for leading into the subject, but they can also pull away from it. Great effort.</td>', 'I love the way you froze the water and captured the child inside the fountain. I keep following the line produced by the front most fountain up the picture and away from the child. Lines can be a powerful tool for leading into the subject, but they can also pull away from it. Great effort.', '2003-07-17 23:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(360312, 28466, 8367, '<td valign="top">Love the compositon and it''s an original idea. The focus isn''t quite right. What appears sharp to me is the area to the right of the skillet instead of the stir-fry. Color and contrast is great.</td>', 'Love the compositon and it''s an original idea. The focus isn''t quite right. What appears sharp to me is the area to the right of the skillet instead of the stir-fry. Color and contrast is great.', '2003-07-17 23:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(360315, 28629, 2612, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but you need to brighten up the lemon. Shots like this, where you have complete control, need to be perfect. Very promising...</td>', 'Good shot, but you need to brighten up the lemon. Shots like this, where you have complete control, need to be perfect. Very promising...', '2003-07-17 23:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(360319, 28629, 8367, '<td valign="top">Good composition  but needs to be sharper.</td>', 'Good composition  but needs to be sharper.', '2003-07-17 23:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(360322, 28755, 8367, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and the border compliments the elements and enhances the photo.</td>', 'Nice angle and the border compliments the elements and enhances the photo.', '2003-07-17 23:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(360330, 28589, 2612, '<td valign="top">Bottom of the photo starts off really good, but the cars on the roadside are a little distracting. If they don''t contribute to the design, cut them out.</td>', 'Bottom of the photo starts off really good, but the cars on the roadside are a little distracting. If they don''t contribute to the design, cut them out.', '2003-07-17 23:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(360331, 28126, 8367, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture. I love the expressions. I''d like to see it sharpened just a little.</td>', 'This is a great capture. I love the expressions. I''d like to see it sharpened just a little.', '2003-07-17 23:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(360337, 28591, 2612, '<td valign="top">Very interesting concept! I don''t think you have to keep all of the complete blocks in the frame, so you could get a little closer and let part of the out blocks cross the border. This might help take some attention away from the background, which is a little to dominate. Very creative, so keep working on the composition.</td>', 'Very interesting concept! I don''t think you have to keep all of the complete blocks in the frame, so you could get a little closer and let part of the out blocks cross the border. This might help take some attention away from the background, which is a little to dominate. Very creative, so keep working on the composition.', '2003-07-17 23:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(360529, 28092, 8860, '<td valign="top">Well that BBQ didn''t go as planned. Great depth to this with masses of detail, action and tangible feeling of heat. Structure in the midst is a little too central perhaps. [8]</td>', 'Well that BBQ didn''t go as planned. Great depth to this with masses of detail, action and tangible feeling of heat. Structure in the midst is a little too central perhaps. [8]', '2003-07-18 05:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(360530, 28639, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice illusion of scale. Image is a bit too soft and I don''t like the border, but a good one anyway. [7]</td>', 'Nice illusion of scale. Image is a bit too soft and I don''t like the border, but a good one anyway. [7]', '2003-07-18 05:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(360531, 28529, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very atmospheric. Nice detail.</td>', 'Very atmospheric. Nice detail.', '2003-07-18 05:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(360532, 28344, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and clear. I just like this, although the background is a bit dull..</td>', 'Very crisp and clear. I just like this, although the background is a bit dull..', '2003-07-18 05:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(360597, 28209, 5955, '<td valign="top">I should Not Try this at home, but i think this is the most amazing shot in this challenge. good luck</td>', 'I should Not Try this at home, but i think this is the most amazing shot in this challenge. good luck', '2003-07-18 08:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(360713, 28738, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice motion freeze. Shame about the background, but you can''t have everything.</td>', 'Nice motion freeze. Shame about the background, but you can''t have everything.', '2003-07-18 13:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(360834, 28678, 4517, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge ok but not to interesting.</td>', 'Meets the challenge ok but not to interesting.', '2003-07-18 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(360908, 28589, 10387, '<td valign="top">Nice texture.  Good composition.  Great idea.</td>', 'Nice texture.  Good composition.  Great idea.', '2003-07-18 19:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(361036, 28589, 10040, '<td valign="top">I love the concept of this photo, but I am not sure it was executed as well as it could have been.  I think you hit the challenge of temperature on the head though.  I would have liked to see a lower camera angle on the egg (closer to the road), with the egg being more of the focal point and the DOF beginning to unfocus about 1-2 feet past the egg (the yellow street lines and the cracked pavement would have told the viewer exactly where the shot was taken).  The car on the left and the other thing on the right definitely distract from the photo.  Just my opinion :)  Like I said, this is a great concept and has a lot of potential.</td>', 'I love the concept of this photo, but I am not sure it was executed as well as it could have been.  I think you hit the challenge of temperature on the head though.  I would have liked to see a lower camera angle on the egg (closer to the road), with the egg being more of the focal point and the DOF beginning to unfocus about 1-2 feet past the egg (the yellow street lines and the cracked pavement would have told the viewer exactly where the shot was taken).  The car on the left and the other thing on the right definitely distract from the photo.  Just my opinion :)  Like I said, this is a great concept and has a lot of potential.', '2003-07-18 22:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(361040, 28544, 10040, '<td valign="top">WOW, great pic!</td>', 'WOW, great pic!', '2003-07-18 22:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(361057, 28639, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice icy blue.  Look forward to learning more about this shot.</td>', 'Nice icy blue.  Look forward to learning more about this shot.', '2003-07-18 23:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(361060, 28678, 1280, '<td valign="top">There''s lots of discoloration and blotches...not terribly creative, the abstractness of it is ok.</td>', 'There''s lots of discoloration and blotches...not terribly creative, the abstractness of it is ok.', '2003-07-18 23:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(361062, 28348, 1280, '<td valign="top">whew!   How can you stand it?  Good picture that speaks volumes!</td>', 'whew!   How can you stand it?  Good picture that speaks volumes!', '2003-07-18 23:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(361074, 28724, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is a nice abstract type of picture.  I like it but it''s not compelling.  I really like the idea of this, and I''m not sure what I would have done differently, but it seems to need something.  Now that I look at it a little longer, I realize I''m not seeing any drips to indicate melt down.  Perhaps that is all it really needs.</td>', 'This is a nice abstract type of picture.  I like it but it''s not compelling.  I really like the idea of this, and I''m not sure what I would have done differently, but it seems to need something.  Now that I look at it a little longer, I realize I''m not seeing any drips to indicate melt down.  Perhaps that is all it really needs.', '2003-07-19 00:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(361081, 28529, 1280, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot....the blue tone adds to the cold theme.</td>', 'Interesting shot....the blue tone adds to the cold theme.', '2003-07-19 00:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(361088, 28088, 1280, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title.  But that''s ok...the pic is icy cold blue.  Meets challenge.</td>', 'I don''t understand the title.  But that''s ok...the pic is icy cold blue.  Meets challenge.', '2003-07-19 00:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(361096, 28350, 1280, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  Could be a bit sharper.</td>', 'Great concept.  Could be a bit sharper.', '2003-07-19 00:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(361108, 28579, 6230, '<td valign="top">Looks delicious rather than hot......</td>', 'Looks delicious rather than hot......', '2003-07-19 01:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(361140, 28400, 280, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot, I think you may have a winner here :)</td>', 'Fantastic shot, I think you may have a winner here :)', '2003-07-19 16:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(361141, 28523, 280, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for these long exposure shots, this one is nicely done but seems to be cropped too close at the top in my humble opinion.</td>', 'I am a sucker for these long exposure shots, this one is nicely done but seems to be cropped too close at the top in my humble opinion.', '2003-07-19 16:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(361144, 28506, 280, '<td valign="top">sorry but this picture is just too small.</td>', 'sorry but this picture is just too small.', '2003-07-19 16:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(361177, 28073, 4411, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. The condensation really gives the impression of a nice cold drink and the glint of sunlight finishes off nicely.<br/>Some puffy clouds directly above the glass would have allowed a narrower crop which I would have preferred, or maybe cropped tighter to the top of the glass to give it a more traditional landcape ratio?</td>', 'Lovely shot. The condensation really gives the impression of a nice cold drink and the glint of sunlight finishes off nicely.Some puffy clouds directly above the glass would have allowed a narrower crop which I would have preferred, or maybe cropped tighter to the top of the glass to give it a more traditional landcape ratio?', '2003-07-19 18:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(361178, 28692, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice capture - should ideally have more of girl''s feet and sign - and straighten it up a bit.</td>', 'Nice capture - should ideally have more of girl''s feet and sign - and straighten it up a bit.', '2003-07-19 18:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(361179, 28544, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea and fresh composition. Crisp and clear focus too, so could be a ribbon for you... [8]</td>', 'Very nice idea and fresh composition. Crisp and clear focus too, so could be a ribbon for you... [8]', '2003-07-19 18:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(361180, 28088, 4411, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail &amp; colour. Can''t help thinking that a pool of water on the table would make this even better, but I like it anyway.</td>', 'Excellent detail & colour. Can''t help thinking that a pool of water on the table would make this even better, but I like it anyway.', '2003-07-19 18:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(361181, 28256, 8860, '<td valign="top">Looks like a giant shadow at first glance. Very striking image of land that was once scorched. [7]</td>', 'Looks like a giant shadow at first glance. Very striking image of land that was once scorched. [7]', '2003-07-19 18:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(361182, 28124, 8860, '<td valign="top">If focus wasn''t so soft this could have been much better-rated. Nice record of the event though.</td>', 'If focus wasn''t so soft this could have been much better-rated. Nice record of the event though.', '2003-07-19 18:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(361183, 28092, 4411, '<td valign="top">Whoa!<br/>The branch poking into the frame is annoying, but the rest of this is superb. Well captured.</td>', 'Whoa!The branch poking into the frame is annoying, but the rest of this is superb. Well captured.', '2003-07-19 18:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(361184, 28523, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot but not particularly reminiscent of temperature. Departure from challenge theme is its only flaw though.</td>', 'Beautiful shot but not particularly reminiscent of temperature. Departure from challenge theme is its only flaw though.', '2003-07-19 19:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(361185, 28749, 4411, '<td valign="top">Super detail. Maybe a little close to the edge of the frame, but a cracking shot anyway.</td>', 'Super detail. Maybe a little close to the edge of the frame, but a cracking shot anyway.', '2003-07-19 19:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(361186, 28506, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is just too small and indistinct to evaluate properly!</td>', 'This is just too small and indistinct to evaluate properly!', '2003-07-19 19:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(361187, 28700, 8860, '<td valign="top">I''m ready for one of those right now! Very refreshing looking - good focus and composition. [7]</td>', 'I''m ready for one of those right now! Very refreshing looking - good focus and composition. [7]', '2003-07-19 19:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(361188, 28763, 4411, '<td valign="top">Too centered. If you cut the left hand side off this you will lose the overexposed areas and gain a much better composition. Otherwise a very nice shot.</td>', 'Too centered. If you cut the left hand side off this you will lose the overexposed areas and gain a much better composition. Otherwise a very nice shot.', '2003-07-19 19:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(361189, 28400, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good ''packshot''. Looks hot and very crisply taken pic with good lighting.</td>', 'Good ''packshot''. Looks hot and very crisply taken pic with good lighting.', '2003-07-19 19:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(361190, 28400, 4411, '<td valign="top">Lose the bottle, that background is awesome! lol.<br/>Seriously, a very well composed, very well taken shot. Love it.</td>', 'Lose the bottle, that background is awesome! lol.Seriously, a very well composed, very well taken shot. Love it.', '2003-07-19 19:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(361263, 28163, 9907, '<td valign="top">need more flame</td>', 'need more flame', '2003-07-19 20:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(361266, 28385, 4411, '<td valign="top">Superb detail, and the colours are fantastic. Great work.</td>', 'Superb detail, and the colours are fantastic. Great work.', '2003-07-19 20:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(361269, 28466, 9907, '<td valign="top">to fuzzy</td>', 'to fuzzy', '2003-07-19 20:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(361338, 28738, 7670, '<td valign="top">great clarity<br/></td>', 'great clarity', '2003-07-19 21:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(361340, 28757, 7670, '<td valign="top">This is an extremely cool picture.</td>', 'This is an extremely cool picture.', '2003-07-19 21:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(361341, 28579, 7670, '<td valign="top">this is nice.  It reminds me of a catalogue picture.</td>', 'this is nice.  It reminds me of a catalogue picture.', '2003-07-19 21:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(361343, 28746, 7670, '<td valign="top">great colors</td>', 'great colors', '2003-07-19 21:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(361344, 28209, 7670, '<td valign="top">The first step to overcoming pyromania is admitting you have a problem...  Good picture.</td>', 'The first step to overcoming pyromania is admitting you have a problem...  Good picture.', '2003-07-19 21:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(361346, 28397, 7670, '<td valign="top">creative</td>', 'creative', '2003-07-19 21:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(361390, 28766, 4882, '<td valign="top">Hey, is this Wisconsin?  Shotgun Eddies?</td>', 'Hey, is this Wisconsin?  Shotgun Eddies?', '2003-07-19 23:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(361447, 28757, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the ice shapes, but I''m not sure the dial or defrosting action add too much. I''d have probably cropped shorter and flipped it to simulate an icy landscape ... "Moguls on a Gray Day."</td>', 'I like the ice shapes, but I''m not sure the dial or defrosting action add too much. I''d have probably cropped shorter and flipped it to simulate an icy landscape ... "Moguls on a Gray Day."', '2003-07-20 02:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(361448, 28506, 1031, '<td valign="top">At this level of detail, it looks more cold than hot to me.</td>', 'At this level of detail, it looks more cold than hot to me.', '2003-07-20 02:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(361449, 28485, 1031, '<td valign="top">A streaking ball might be a nice addition, but a good stop-action shot anyway.</td>', 'A streaking ball might be a nice addition, but a good stop-action shot anyway.', '2003-07-20 02:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(361450, 28612, 1031, '<td valign="top">Probably the first word of your title would have been enough. You might re-crop this later and add to the "funny license plate" collection in some recent thread.</td>', 'Probably the first word of your title would have been enough. You might re-crop this later and add to the "funny license plate" collection in some recent thread.', '2003-07-20 02:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(361451, 28397, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good idea and well-executed example of this technique.</td>', 'Good idea and well-executed example of this technique.', '2003-07-20 02:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(361453, 28707, 1031, '<td valign="top">Hard to tell for sure what the air temperature is, but an outstanding sunset photo regardless.</td>', 'Hard to tell for sure what the air temperature is, but an outstanding sunset photo regardless.', '2003-07-20 02:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(361454, 28092, 1031, '<td valign="top">I assume you will post a tutorial on how you set up this shot. I think some people may be spending too much on these contests.</td>', 'I assume you will post a tutorial on how you set up this shot. I think some people may be spending too much on these contests.', '2003-07-20 02:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(361455, 28589, 1031, '<td valign="top">I suppose putting a non-stick coating on a road surface wouldn''t be quite practical. Good thing you like them "sunny-side up." Around here, a sidewalk is the preferred frying utensil, but the blacktop will reach a higher temperature. I think you could maybe crop out most of the cars without losing impact.</td>', 'I suppose putting a non-stick coating on a road surface wouldn''t be quite practical. Good thing you like them "sunny-side up." Around here, a sidewalk is the preferred frying utensil, but the blacktop will reach a higher temperature. I think you could maybe crop out most of the cars without losing impact.', '2003-07-20 02:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(361456, 28653, 1031, '<td valign="top">Sunny-side up seems to be the order of the day. You''d probably have to use a ton of grease to keep them from sticking. Good control over DOF, but I wish the cameras weren''t quite so rapid in the degree of OOF in the foreground; more as it occurs in the background. Might not be optically possible though ....</td>', 'Sunny-side up seems to be the order of the day. You''d probably have to use a ton of grease to keep them from sticking. Good control over DOF, but I wish the cameras weren''t quite so rapid in the degree of OOF in the foreground; more as it occurs in the background. Might not be optically possible though ....', '2003-07-20 02:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(361457, 28454, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones. I like the darkness and the contrast of reddish light here that really communicate hot! 10</td>', 'Wonderful tones. I like the darkness and the contrast of reddish light here that really communicate hot! 10', '2003-07-20 02:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(361458, 28607, 6870, '<td valign="top">The creative use of three matchsticks here really make this stand out. 10</td>', 'The creative use of three matchsticks here really make this stand out. 10', '2003-07-20 02:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(361459, 28548, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the way your fingers make the ice into a heart-shaped outline. I don''t think I like the figures in the ice, but it''s hard to tell with seeing the alternative.</td>', 'I like the way your fingers make the ice into a heart-shaped outline. I don''t think I like the figures in the ice, but it''s hard to tell with seeing the alternative.', '2003-07-20 02:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(361485, 28523, 3540, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  I love longer exposures on waterfalls, they look so soft and surreal.  This is as good as it gets.  Great work. 10</td>', 'Beautiful image.  I love longer exposures on waterfalls, they look so soft and surreal.  This is as good as it gets.  Great work. 10', '2003-07-20 08:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(361486, 28558, 3540, '<td valign="top">I understand the concept of this pic, but the printed photo resolution is very bad.  The fire isn''t showing really well either.  I like the idea, the execution just didn''t turn out as well as it could have.</td>', 'I understand the concept of this pic, but the printed photo resolution is very bad.  The fire isn''t showing really well either.  I like the idea, the execution just didn''t turn out as well as it could have.', '2003-07-20 08:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(361488, 28749, 3540, '<td valign="top">I get the sensation that 1000 little polyester fibers are stuck in my teeth.  The little hairlike things are reall visable against the dark chocolate.  Honestly, this is pretty good and a great idea.  nice job</td>', 'I get the sensation that 1000 little polyester fibers are stuck in my teeth.  The little hairlike things are reall visable against the dark chocolate.  Honestly, this is pretty good and a great idea.  nice job', '2003-07-20 08:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(361489, 28485, 3540, '<td valign="top">Too bad they didn''t have a better field.  I don''t really see this meeting the challenge though.  Throwing the heat has more to do with velocity than temperature, right?</td>', 'Too bad they didn''t have a better field.  I don''t really see this meeting the challenge though.  Throwing the heat has more to do with velocity than temperature, right?', '2003-07-20 08:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(361491, 28535, 3540, '<td valign="top">The colors on this one look way off, more pink than yellow or red or orange.  I think a slight adjustment would''ve been a better bet and maybe even brightening up the yellows a bit.  This doesn''t look convincingly hot to me.</td>', 'The colors on this one look way off, more pink than yellow or red or orange.  I think a slight adjustment would''ve been a better bet and maybe even brightening up the yellows a bit.  This doesn''t look convincingly hot to me.', '2003-07-20 08:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(361492, 28629, 3540, '<td valign="top">You lost the focus on the lemon.  A little wider aperture and you''d have had it.  This isn''t a bad photo though, just need to focus on the whole thing.</td>', 'You lost the focus on the lemon.  A little wider aperture and you''d have had it.  This isn''t a bad photo though, just need to focus on the whole thing.', '2003-07-20 08:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(361493, 28767, 3540, '<td valign="top">You left a little booger at the bottom left when you rotated the picture and didn''t crop out all the leftovers.  The idea isn''t bad.  Looks a little too processed and frankly, a little too flat.  Putting one bottle in the foreground and putting one back a few more inches would''ve added some depth to the picture.</td>', 'You left a little booger at the bottom left when you rotated the picture and didn''t crop out all the leftovers.  The idea isn''t bad.  Looks a little too processed and frankly, a little too flat.  Putting one bottle in the foreground and putting one back a few more inches would''ve added some depth to the picture.', '2003-07-20 08:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(361495, 28544, 3540, '<td valign="top">I took a lot of these in April when we had our freezing rain.  You must be in the southern hemisphere somewhere.  This isn''t bad, but I''m not stunned by it or anything.</td>', 'I took a lot of these in April when we had our freezing rain.  You must be in the southern hemisphere somewhere.  This isn''t bad, but I''m not stunned by it or anything.', '2003-07-20 08:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
