(361867, 28092, 6888, '<td valign="top">What a shock...<br/> <br/>Thanks everyone for the votes and nice comments.<br/> <br/>This was a controlled burn by our local fire department on the building used by an animal shelter here.  I was able to get within about 50 yards of the building and let me tell you, it was some intense heat.<br/> <br/>Thanks again everyone.</td>', 'What a shock... Thanks everyone for the votes and nice comments. This was a controlled burn by our local fire department on the building used by an animal shelter here.  I was able to get within about 50 yards of the building and let me tell you, it was some intense heat. Thanks again everyone.', '2003-07-21 01:12:48.000000', NULL, 0),
