(361935, 28395, 7778, '<td valign="top">Evaluating the stats:<br/> <br/>I see forty votes in the 1 - 3 range, sixteen of which are 1''s. A near equal number of voters awarded a rating between 6 and 10. The discrepancy is not quite clear to me.<br/> <br/>Six (6!) voters commented, three of which I marked as ''helpful''. The remaining three comments were not at all helpful, since no reason(s) was (were) given to substantiate the judgements expressed. One was clearly uninformed and a little too personal and derogatory to reflect anything sincere or warrant a response.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-07-21 00:46:47.</i></td>', 'Evaluating the stats: I see forty votes in the 1 - 3 range, sixteen of which are 1''s. A near equal number of voters awarded a rating between 6 and 10. The discrepancy is not quite clear to me. Six (6!) voters commented, three of which I marked as ''helpful''. The remaining three comments were not at all helpful, since no reason(s) was (were) given to substantiate the judgements expressed. One was clearly uninformed and a little too personal and derogatory to reflect anything sincere or warrant a response.', '2003-07-21 01:45:51.000000', '2003-07-21 01:46:47.000000', 0),
(361938, 28225, 5313, '<td valign="top">Great job, Ursula!  Yes, the poor girl--summer in Ottawa is certainly not the time to be dressed like that!</td>', 'Great job, Ursula!  Yes, the poor girl--summer in Ottawa is certainly not the time to be dressed like that!', '2003-07-21 01:49:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(361951, 28395, 8911, '<td valign="top">I liked this one okay but felt that it could have been stronger, also. The curving lines of the ocean are nice, the placement of the subject is nice. But the bright reflection in the sunglasses suggests it is daylight and the overall darkness of the photo otherwise looks like dusk - and the tones look somewhat out of true. I''d have liked to see this brightened a bit.</td>', 'I liked this one okay but felt that it could have been stronger, also. The curving lines of the ocean are nice, the placement of the subject is nice. But the bright reflection in the sunglasses suggests it is daylight and the overall darkness of the photo otherwise looks like dusk - and the tones look somewhat out of true. I''d have liked to see this brightened a bit.', '2003-07-21 02:04:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(361967, 28400, 5705, '<td valign="top">My top shot, once again congrats on a superb photo!</td>', 'My top shot, once again congrats on a superb photo!', '2003-07-21 02:32:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(361968, 28395, 7778, '<td valign="top">While I accept anyone''s aesthetic preference, the effect you refer to was needed to emphasize the perceived surrealism inherent in the given (prior to camera interference) scene (the overly rich hues, the white chests of the pidgeons in the distance). Without it, this critical element  would have been lost.<br/> <br/>The photo was taken early in the day, btw.<br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'While I accept anyone''s aesthetic preference, the effect you refer to was needed to emphasize the perceived surrealism inherent in the given (prior to camera interference) scene (the overly rich hues, the white chests of the pidgeons in the distance). Without it, this critical element  would have been lost. The photo was taken early in the day, btw.  ', '2003-07-21 02:35:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(361976, 28400, 9331, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to vote this time around but I did have a quick look through before the voting finished and this was the stand out shot to me.<br/>Don''t know how anyone could have voted it 1 or 2?? That''s a bit beyond me as it portrays heat exceptionally well.<br/> <br/>If I was you, I''d contact the company for the chili sauce and see if they want to use this in their advertising.<br/> <br/>Great shot</td>', 'I didn''t get to vote this time around but I did have a quick look through before the voting finished and this was the stand out shot to me.Don''t know how anyone could have voted it 1 or 2?? That''s a bit beyond me as it portrays heat exceptionally well. If I was you, I''d contact the company for the chili sauce and see if they want to use this in their advertising. Great shot', '2003-07-21 02:40:23.000000', NULL, 0),
