(363669, 28529, 7033, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dsidwell:</b></div><hr/><i><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pncowley:</b></div><hr/><i>Just one question, though... what made you choose oreos for the balance of the shot?</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Good question. When I find that out, I''ll let you know, but it''s probably the same reason I used green kisses and a red apple in another of my shots. Maybe I''m just bizarre!</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Or a trout in a bowl of cereal?  :-)  Just wondering, of course, since the result(s) have been fantastic (and I would never even have considered putting them together...)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by dsidwell:Originally posted by pncowley:Just one question, though... what made you choose oreos for the balance of the shot?  Good question. When I find that out, I''ll let you know, but it''s probably the same reason I used green kisses and a red apple in another of my shots. Maybe I''m just bizarre!  Or a trout in a bowl of cereal?  :-)  Just wondering, of course, since the result(s) have been fantastic (and I would never even have considered putting them together...) ', '2003-07-22 15:24:04.000000', NULL, 0),
