(690499, 28612, 17720, '<td valign="top">Man, I have a Cherokee and drove it to Colorado Springs one summer - the whole way there I had overheating trouble!  I ended up having to replace the water pump by myself (Memorial day weekend - no repair shops open) on the way there and the radiator on the way back.  I can sure relate to this!</td>', 'Man, I have a Cherokee and drove it to Colorado Springs one summer - the whole way there I had overheating trouble!  I ended up having to replace the water pump by myself (Memorial day weekend - no repair shops open) on the way there and the radiator on the way back.  I can sure relate to this!', '2004-04-29 10:47:45.000000', NULL, 0),
